<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Test Lab - 게임 캐릭터 선택 및 전투 과제 프로토타입</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-color: #0f172a;
            --card-bg: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.85);
            --card-border: #334155;
            --primary: #6366f1;
            --primary-hover: #4f46e5;
            --accent: #14b8a6;
            --accent-hover: #0d9488;
            --danger: #ef4444;
            --text-main: #f8fafc;
            --text-muted: #94a3b8;
            --gold: #f59e0b;
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: 'Pretendard', 'Malgun Gothic', -apple-system, sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--bg-color);
            color: var(--text-main);
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: space-between;
            background-image: radial-gradient(#1e293b 1px, transparent 1px);
            background-size: 24px 24px;
        }

        header {
            background-color: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.9);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--card-border);
            padding: 1rem 2rem;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 50;
            backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
        }

        .logo-group h1 {
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--text-main);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
        }

        .badge {
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem;
            border-radius: 9999px;
            background-color: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.2);
            color: #a5b4fc;
            border: 1px solid rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.4);
        }

        .progress-steps {
            display: flex;
            gap: 0.5rem;
            align-items: center;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
        }

        .step-pill {
            padding: 0.4rem 0.8rem;
            border-radius: 9999px;
            background-color: #1e293b;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .step-pill.active {
            background-color: var(--primary);
            color: #fff;
            border-color: var(--primary);
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .btn-restart {
            padding: 0.4rem 0.8rem;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            background-color: #334155;
            color: #f8fafc;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 0.5rem;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: background-color 0.2s;
        }
        .btn-restart:hover { background-color: #475569; }

        main {
            flex: 1;
            max-width: 1200px;
            width: 100%;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 2rem 1rem;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .phase-card {
            width: 100%;
            background-color: var(--card-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
            border-radius: 1rem;
            padding: 2rem;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 25px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
            backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
        }

        .hidden { display: none !important; }

        .form-group {
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        .form-group label {
            display: block;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            color: #cbd5e1;
        }

        .input-text {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
            background-color: #0f172a;
            border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
            border-radius: 0.5rem;
            color: #fff;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }
        .input-text:focus {
            outline: none;
            border-color: var(--primary);
        }

        .radio-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
            gap: 1rem;
        }

        .radio-card {
            position: relative;
            background-color: #0f172a;
            border: 2px solid var(--card-border);
            padding: 1rem;
            border-radius: 0.75rem;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: border-color 0.2s;
        }
        .radio-card:hover { border-color: #475569; }
        .radio-card input { position: absolute; opacity: 0; }
        .radio-card.selected {
            border-color: var(--primary);
            background-color: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.05);
        }

        .radio-title {
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 1rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
            color: #fff;
        }
        .radio-desc {
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
        }

        .btn-primary {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 0.85rem;
            background-color: var(--primary);
            color: #fff;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 1rem;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 0.75rem;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: background-color 0.2s;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.3);
        }
        .btn-primary:hover { background-color: var(--primary-hover); }

        .task-header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            background-color: #0f172a;
            padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
            border-radius: 0.75rem;
            border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        .timer-box {
            display: flex;
            gap: 1.5rem;
            font-family: monospace;
        }

        .timer-item { text-align: right; }
        .timer-label {
            font-size: 0.7rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            text-transform: uppercase;
            display: block;
        }
        .timer-value {
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--accent);
        }
        .timer-value.warning {
            color: var(--danger);
            animation: blink 0.5s infinite alternate;
        }

        @keyframes blink {
            from { opacity: 1; }
            to { opacity: 0.4; }
        }

        .char-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
            gap: 1.25rem;
        }

        .char-card {
            background-color: #0f172a;
            border: 2px solid var(--card-border);
            border-radius: 0.85rem;
            padding: 1.25rem;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: space-between;
            transition: all 0.25s ease;
            position: relative;
        }

        .char-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-4px);
            border-color: var(--primary);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
        }

        .char-badge {
            align-self: flex-start;
            font-size: 0.7rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            padding: 0.2rem 0.5rem;
            border-radius: 0.375rem;
            background-color: #1e293b;
            color: #cbd5e1;
            margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
        }

        .char-avatar-canvas {
            width: 100px;
            height: 100px;
            margin: 0 auto 0.75rem auto;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background-color: #1e293b;
            border: 2px solid #334155;
            display: block;
        }

        .char-name {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
        }

        .char-tagline {
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            min-height: 2.2em;
        }

        .stat-list {
            background-color: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.5);
            padding: 0.75rem;
            border-radius: 0.5rem;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
        }

        .stat-row {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
        }

        .char-lore {
            font-size: 0.78rem;
            color: #94a3b8;
            line-height: 1.4;
            background-color: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6);
            padding: 0.75rem;
            border-radius: 0.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            flex-grow: 1;
        }

        .btn-select {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 0.6rem;
            background-color: #334155;
            color: #fff;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 0.5rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.2s;
        }

        .char-card:hover .btn-select { background-color: var(--primary); }

        #game-canvas-container {
            position: relative;
            width: 100%;
            height: 380px;
            background-color: #020617;
            border: 2px solid var(--card-border);
            border-radius: 0.75rem;
            overflow: hidden;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        #gameCanvas {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            display: block;
        }

        .game-hud {
            position: absolute;
            top: 10px;
            left: 10px;
            right: 10px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            pointer-events: none;
            z-index: 10;
        }

        .hud-hp-box {
            background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.8);
            border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
            padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
            border-radius: 0.5rem;
            color: #fff;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            width: 280px;
        }

        .hp-bar-bg {
            width: 100%;
            height: 12px;
            background: #334155;
            border-radius: 6px;
            overflow: hidden;
            margin-top: 4px;
        }

        .hp-bar-fill {
            height: 100%;
            background: var(--danger);
            width: 100%;
            transition: width 0.1s linear;
        }

        .player-hp-fill { background: #22c55e; }

        .controls-guide {
            background-color: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.7);
            padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
            border-radius: 0.5rem;
            border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            color: #cbd5e1;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-around;
        }

        .survey-q {
            background-color: #0f172a;
            padding: 1.25rem;
            border-radius: 0.75rem;
            border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
            margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
        }

        .survey-q-title {
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            color: #f1f5f9;
        }

        .likert-scale {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
        }

        .likert-opt {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.3rem;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .likert-opt input {
            accent-color: var(--primary);
            width: 1.1rem;
            height: 1.1rem;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .dash-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
            gap: 1rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        .dash-stat-card {
            background-color: #0f172a;
            border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
            padding: 1.25rem;
            border-radius: 0.75rem;
        }

        .dash-stat-label {
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            display: block;
        }

        .dash-stat-val {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--accent);
            font-family: monospace;
        }

        .charts-container {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));
            gap: 1.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        .chart-box {
            background-color: #0f172a;
            border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
            border-radius: 0.75rem;
            padding: 1.25rem;
        }

        .chart-title {
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            color: #e2e8f0;
        }

        .table-container {
            overflow-x: auto;
            background-color: #0f172a;
            border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
            border-radius: 0.75rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            text-align: left;
        }

        th, td {
            padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--card-border);
        }

        th {
            background-color: #1e293b;
            color: #94a3b8;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .btn-export {
            background-color: var(--accent);
            color: #fff;
            padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 0.5rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: background-color 0.2s;
        }
        .btn-export:hover { background-color: var(--accent-hover); }

        footer {
            border-top: 1px solid var(--card-border);
            padding: 1rem;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            background-color: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.9);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <div class="logo-group">
            <h1>🎮 Test Lab <span class="badge">배승유 연구용 v2.1</span></h1>
        </div>
        <div class="progress-steps">
            <span id="step-1" class="step-pill active">1. 조건 설정</span>
            <span id="step-2" class="step-pill">2. 캐릭터 선택</span>
            <span id="step-2-5" class="step-pill">2.5 전투 플레이</span>
            <span id="step-3" class="step-pill">3. 인지 설문</span>
            <span id="step-4" class="step-pill">4. 결과 대시보드</span>
        </div>
        <button class="btn-restart" onclick="resetExperiment()">실험 재시작</button>
    </header>

    <main>
        <!-- 1단계: 연구 조건 설정 -->
        <section id="phase-1" class="phase-card">
            <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 2rem;">
                <h2 style="font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">연구 참가자 설정 및 실험 조건 선택</h2>
                <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-muted);">게임 인터페이스 내 유저 의사결정 요소 추적 실험을 시작합니다.</p>
            </div>

            <form id="form-setup" onsubmit="handleStartExperiment(event)">
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="participant-id">참가자 식별 ID</label>
                    <input type="text" id="participant-id" class="input-text" required placeholder="예: P_2026_01" value="P_DIRECT_TEST">
                </div>

                <div class="form-group">
                    <label>실험 조건 A: 시간 제한 여부</label>
                    <div class="radio-grid">
                        <div class="radio-card selected" onclick="selectRadio(this, 'timeCondition', 'normal')">
                            <input type="radio" name="timeCondition" value="normal" checked>
                            <div class="radio-title">제한 없음 (일반)</div>
                            <div class="radio-desc">시간 제약 없이 충분히 정보를 탐색한 후 캐릭터를 선택합니다.</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="radio-card" onclick="selectRadio(this, 'timeCondition', 'pressure')">
                            <input type="radio" name="timeCondition" value="pressure">
                            <div class="radio-title">시간 압박 (5초 제한)</div>
                            <div class="radio-desc">5초 카운트다운 내에 빠르게 판단하여 캐릭터를 선택합니다.</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="form-group">
                    <label>실험 조건 B: 정보 제시 방식</label>
                    <div class="radio-grid">
                        <div class="radio-card selected" onclick="selectRadio(this, 'infoCondition', 'balanced')">
                            <input type="radio" name="infoCondition" value="balanced" checked>
                            <div class="radio-title">서사와 성능을 함께 제시</div>
                            <div class="radio-desc">캐릭터의 스토리/외형과 능력치/티어 정보가 모두 제공됩니다.</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="radio-card" onclick="selectRadio(this, 'infoCondition', 'lore')">
                            <input type="radio" name="infoCondition" value="lore">
                            <div class="radio-title">서사·외형 강조</div>
                            <div class="radio-desc">스토리 및 배경 설정 정보가 강조되어 표시됩니다.</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <button type="submit" class="btn-primary">실험 시작하기 (캐릭터 선택 단계로)</button>
            </form>
        </section>

        <!-- 2단계: 캐릭터 선택 과제 -->
        <section id="phase-2" class="phase-card hidden">
            <div class="task-header">
                <div>
                    <h2 style="font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 0.25rem;">원하는 캐릭터를 선택하세요</h2>
                    <p style="font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--text-muted);">카드에 마우스를 올려 상세 정보를 확인하고 최종 확정하십시오.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="timer-box">
                    <div class="timer-item">
                        <span class="timer-label">선택 고민 시간</span>
                        <span id="timer-elapsed" class="timer-value">0.0s</span>
                    </div>
                    <div id="countdown-box" class="timer-item hidden">
                        <span class="timer-label">남은 시간</span>
                        <span id="timer-countdown" class="timer-value warning">5.0s</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="char-grid" id="char-card-container">
                <!-- Dynamic Content -->
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- 2.5단계: 실제 인게임 전투 플레이 -->
        <section id="phase-2-5" class="phase-card hidden">
            <div class="task-header">
                <div>
                    <h2 style="font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 0.25rem;">[실행 단계] 선택한 캐릭터 전투 과제</h2>
                    <p style="font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--text-muted);">보스 몬스터의 공격을 피하면서 제한시간 15초 내에 보스의 HP(2,500)를 최대한 깎으세요!</p>
                </div>
                <div class="timer-box">
                    <div class="timer-item">
                        <span class="timer-label">전투 남은 시간</span>
                        <span id="combat-timer" class="timer-value warning">15.0s</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="controls-guide">
                <span>🕹️ <b>이동:</b> W, A, S, D 키</span>
                <span>🎯 <b>일반 공격:</b> 마우스 좌클릭 (마우스 방향 발사)</span>
                <span>💥 <b>특수 스킬:</b> Space 키</span>
                <span id="char-skill-desc" style="color: var(--gold);"><b>캐릭터 특성:</b> 일반공격: 자동 추적 미사일 / Space: 융단 포격</span>
            </div>

            <div id="game-canvas-container">
                <div class="game-hud">
                    <div class="hud-hp-box">
                        <div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; font-size:0.75rem;">
                            <span id="player-hud-title">V-800 타이탄 (Player)</span>
                            <span id="player-hp-text">100 / 100</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="hp-bar-bg">
                            <div id="player-hp-fill" class="hp-bar-fill player-hp-fill"></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="hud-hp-box">
                        <div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; font-size:0.75rem;">
                            <span style="color:#ef4444; font-weight:bold;">드래곤 보스 HP</span>
                            <span id="boss-hp-text">2500 / 2500</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="hp-bar-bg">
                            <div id="boss-hp-fill" class="hp-bar-fill"></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <canvas id="gameCanvas" width="800" height="380"></canvas>
            </div>

            <button id="btn-finish-combat" class="btn-primary hidden" onclick="finishCombatTask()">전투 종료 (설문 작성으로 이동)</button>
        </section>

        <!-- 3단계: 인지 및 심리 평가 설문 -->
        <section id="phase-3" class="phase-card hidden">
            <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 2rem;">
                <h2 style="font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">선택 및 플레이 경험 사후 평가</h2>
                <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-muted);">방금 하신 캐릭터 선택 및 전투 경험에 대해 답해 주세요. (7점 리커트 척도)</p>
            </div>

            <form id="form-survey" onsubmit="handleSurveySubmit(event)">
                <div class="survey-q">
                    <div class="survey-q-title">Q1. 방금 내가 내린 캐릭터 선택 결과에 만족한다. (선택 만족도)</div>
                    <div class="likert-scale">
                        <label class="likert-opt"><span>전혀 아니다</span><input type="radio" name="q_sat" value="1" required></label>
